۶. به تعداد تکرار دلخواه انجام دهید.', 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/omercotkd/exercises-gifs@ebf642cd90fdf73a6c73e7127e93b607b12c229e/assets/0350.gif', 'biceps', 'forearm', '1. Lie flat on a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing up and arms fully extended.
2. Keeping your upper arms stationary, exhale and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.
