۶. به تعداد تکرار دلخواه، دست‌ها را یکی در میان ادامه دهید.', 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/omercotkd/exercises-gifs@ebf642cd90fdf73a6c73e7127e93b607b12c229e/assets/0388.gif', 'deltoids', 'triceps,chest', '1. Sit on a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.
2. Raise the dumbbells to shoulder height, with your elbows bent and palms facing forward.
