6. Inhale and slowly lower the dumbbell back to the starting position.
7. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch arms.', '0421') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET name_fa = excluded.name_fa, name_en = excluded.name_en, category = excluded.category, category_fa = excluded.category_fa, equipment = excluded.equipment, equipment_fa = excluded.equipment_fa, target_muscles = excluded.target_muscles, secondary_muscles = excluded.secondary_muscles, instructions_fa = excluded.instructions_fa, gif_url = excluded.gif_url, muscles_primary = excluded.muscles_primary, muscles_secondary = excluded.muscles_secondary, instructions_en = excluded.instructions_en, source_id = excluded.source_id;
INSERT INTO exercises (id, name_fa, name_en, category, category_fa, equipment, equipment_fa, target_muscles, secondary_muscles, instructions_fa, gif_url, muscles_primary, muscles_secondary, instructions_en, source_id) VALUES ('ex_db_0422', 'جلو بازو تک‌دست ایستاده روی نیمکت شیب‌دار دمبل', 'Dumbbell standing one arm curl (over incline bench)', 'arms', 'بازو', 'dumbbell', 'دمبل', 'جلو بازو', 'ساعد', '۱. بایستید، پاها را به اندازه عرض شانه باز کنید و یک دمبل در یک دست با کف دست رو به جلو بگیرید.
